  "creator": "NHS",
  "description": "The NHS post-workout stretch used after all its 10-minute workouts: buttock, hamstring, inner thigh, calf and thigh stretches held 15 to 20 seconds, one-sided ones on both sides. Takes about five minutes; stay longer on anything tight. Modelled as timed holds with the lower end of the range.",
